          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But my men did not kill the best sheep and cattle that they captured; instead, they brought them here to Gilgal to offer as a sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
